3743.295100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5NUl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3f70da3-b99c-4d82-b2f5-dfe98a9c2813","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"怒られないように`let g:loadded_{ruby,perl}_provider = 0` してる。","ts":"1624163554.294700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"banjaku","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ChK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a741549-ef16-4ce8-8fbc-3f3fa7006ace","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"rubyとかperlとかもcheckhealthで怒られますね（いれてない）","ts":"1624163286.293600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ah5r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb0064d3-2127-4773-9cd0-105d4be06045","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"python2 外そうぜ、という話はあるようです。\n\u003chttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/13323\u003e","ts":"1624163192.293100","thread_ts":"1624162487.283000","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/13323|#13323 python2 is deprecated - Neovim roadmap to get rid of it\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/13323|#13323 python2 is deprecated - Neovim roadmap to get rid of it\u003e","text":"I'm more and more thankful I chose `vim` over the alternatives (going back 30 years now). `neovim` is exactly as you all first described it when I first started using it about 7 or so years ago. Thank you!\n\nOne thorn in my side - upgrading python. Every time it seems. Today I upgraded `gem` per the `checkhealth` request and for whatever reason it had me problem solve my install of python (using `pyenv` and `fishshell` has its own quirks)... I digress. But, it does describe my context for this request.\n\nMight it be possible to post some sort of plan for what to expect for how neovim will ultimately remove or otherwise treat differently anything to do with `python` aka `python2`. For instance, at what point will `python` start being an alias for `python3`? Are there hidden dependencies by plugins that somehow we need to keep an eye out for...\n\nThanks in advance!\n\n- E","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"0.kind: bug-vim","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"6","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/neovim/neovim|neovim/neovim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1605738737}],"subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gbIbO"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"72939968-7826-4865-b2ec-34a112f288a8","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"checkhealthすると怒られるけど…","ts":"1624162487.283000","thread_ts":"1624162487.283000","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"095T"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"89809b4a-5aca-429d-8aa3-29b1d33d7a72","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まず1つのファイルの集約されることが大事ってのはあるだろうしね\nただ、独自部分は現在標準化の問題があるからなあ","ts":"1624162971.292700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B7Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ba6fbf4-46be-498d-ae82-707354470566","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"あとeditable pip installがtoml読んでくれないつらみが…","ts":"1624162962.292300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"axwB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cee8d0c0-0931-4d33-8a88-4ab59fec5a4b","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"poetryもpyproject.tomlを使うとはいえ、tomlの記述はpoetry専用なのであんまりpyproject.tomlに準拠してるっていうのはなんかちがくない？という感じもある","ts":"1624162918.291600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":2,"users":[